================================================================================
SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
================================================================================

This MIT License applies ONLY to the SliceBench source code (Python modules
under slicebench/, the runner CLI, the scorer, plot scripts, theme files,
loaders, and pricing tables). It DOES NOT apply to the per-dataset image
content or per-dataset ground-truth coordinates included with SliceBench.

Each dataset under data/datasets/<plane>/<dataset>/ carries its own LICENSE
and NOTICE files specifying the dataset's terms (CC BY 4.0 for EBRAINS Kondo,
Zenodo PNN/PV, and DeepSlice GT; Allen Institute Terms of Use for Allen
Mouse Brain Connectivity Atlas and Allen Developing Mouse Brain Atlas).

For an overview of every dataset's license + citation in one place, see
./NOTICE (top-level attribution index for SliceBench).
